\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\Sigma\\in\\mathfrak A\\;\\forall L\\in\\mathcal F\\cap\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\\;L\\cap R\\in\\mathcal F\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}trio\\text{-}and\\text{-}full\\text{-}trio}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{RegInt}(\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\Sigma\\in\\mathfrak A\\;\\forall L\\in\\mathcal F\\cap\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\\;L\\cap R\\in\\mathcal F\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}trio\\text{-}and\\text{-}full\\text{-}trio}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{InvHom}(\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\Sigma,\\Delta\\in\\mathfrak A\\;\\forall h:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Delta^*\\;[\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(h)\\Longrightarrow\\forall L\\in\\mathcal F\\cap\\mathcal P(\\Delta^*)\\;h^{-1}[L]\\in\\mathcal F]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}trio\\text{-}and\\text{-}full\\text{-}trio}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{InvHom}(\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\Sigma,\\Delta\\in\\mathfrak A\\;\\forall h:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Delta^*\\;[\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(h)\\Longrightarrow\\forall L\\in\\mathcal F\\cap\\mathcal P(\\Delta^*)\\;h^{-1}[L]\\in\\mathcal F]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}trio\\text{-}and\\text{-}full\\text{-}trio}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HomClosed}(\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\Sigma,\\Delta\\in\\mathfrak A\\;\\forall h:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Delta^*\\;[\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(h)\\Longrightarrow\\forall L\\in\\mathcal F\\cap\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)\\;h[L]\\in\\mathcal F]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}trio\\text{-}and\\text{-}full\\text{-}trio}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HomClosed}(\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\Sigma,\\Delta\\in\\mathfrak A\\;\\forall h:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Delta^*\\;[\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(h)\\Longrightarrow\\forall L\\in\\mathcal F\\cap\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)\\;h[L]\\in\\mathcal F]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}trio\\text{-}and\\text{-}full\\text{-}trio}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NEHomClosed}(\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\Sigma,\\Delta\\in\\mathfrak A\\;\\forall h:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Delta^*\\;[\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(h)\\land\\operatorname{Nonerasing}(h)\\Longrightarrow\\forall L\\in\\mathcal F\\cap\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)\\;h[L]\\in\\mathcal F]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}trio\\text{-}and\\text{-}full\\text{-}trio}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NEHomClosed}(\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\Sigma,\\Delta\\in\\mathfrak A\\;\\forall h:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Delta^*\\;[\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(h)\\land\\operatorname{Nonerasing}(h)\\Longrightarrow\\forall L\\in\\mathcal F\\cap\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)\\;h[L]\\in\\mathcal F]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}trio\\text{-}and\\text{-}full\\text{-}trio}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Trio}(\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Family}(\\mathcal F)\\land\\operatorname{RegInt}(\\mathcal F)\\land\\operatorname{InvHom}(\\mathcal F)\\land\\operatorname{NEHomClosed}(\\mathcal F)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}trio\\text{-}and\\text{-}full\\text{-}trio}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Trio}(\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Family}(\\mathcal F)\\land\\operatorname{RegInt}(\\mathcal F)\\land\\operatorname{InvHom}(\\mathcal F)\\land\\operatorname{NEHomClosed}(\\mathcal F)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}trio\\text{-}and\\text{-}full\\text{-}trio}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FullTrio}(\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Family}(\\mathcal F)\\land\\operatorname{RegInt}(\\mathcal F)\\land\\operatorname{InvHom}(\\mathcal F)\\land\\operatorname{HomClosed}(\\mathcal F)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}trio\\text{-}and\\text{-}full\\text{-}trio}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FullTrio}(\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Family}(\\mathcal F)\\land\\operatorname{RegInt}(\\mathcal F)\\land\\operatorname{InvHom}(\\mathcal F)\\land\\operatorname{HomClosed}(\\mathcal F)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>Full 的区别在正向同态是否允许擦除。逆同态始终允许任意同态；不能把两个方向的擦除条件混在一起。交正则语言也不意味着族对任意两个成员的交封闭。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-families-of-languages","status":"resolved","id":"aef862f28dead7fd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-families-of-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-word-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"85832410fcdc9965","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-word-homomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"c284ffb568a496fd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":""